        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin FED-TSR, Baldwin Reserve Collection Federal Lever with Traditional Square Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Federal Leverset with Square Rose is a very sophisticated looking leverset. The combination of the sleek yet classic lever paired with the more modern look of the square rose makes it a popular choice for designers everywhere. This leverset is easy to install. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2-1/2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Federal Lever is available in passage, privacy and dummy functions. It is also available as a grade 2 keyed entry function. Choose from one of the 6 beautiful finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Federal Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2-1/8\" cross bore and 1\" edge bore for latch</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Keyed entry features the Baldwin 5-pin tumbler C keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Tested to exceed ANSI/BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Federal Lever with Square Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry Projection: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-19/32\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 2\" standard with optional thick door kit for 2\" - 2-1/2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy:</b> Non-working levers. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. Interior roses and Half Dummy roses have exposed screws.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-Traditional-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"523\" height=\"71\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin Reserve Finish Options\">\r\n</p>",
