                "title": "Federal Leverset with Square Rose, Baldwin FED-TSR",
                "description": "Baldwin FED-TSR, Federal Leverset with Square Rose - The Federal Leverset with Square Rose is a very sophisticated looking leverset. The combination of the sleek yet classic lever paired with the more modern look of the square rose makes it a popular choice for designers everywhere. This leverset is easy to install. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2-1/2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Federal Lever is available in passage, privacy and dummy functions. It is also available as a grade 2 keyed entry function. Choose from one of the 6 beautiful finishes.",
